The Serpent Column was originally located in Delphi, but was relocated to Constantinople by Emperor Constantine I. As you look at it now, it still has its three serpent heads; though in your time of the 21st century, it has lost this portion of the column.

Though this is not the solution to your adventure, you should know that you can find more information at this column's original home if you seek out the Oracle of Delphi. Good luck!